    {"id":"mcp_server_text","type":"text","x":160,"y":325,"width":430,"height":100,"text":"🖥️ MCP Server Core\n\nRecibe el mensaje JSON-RPC 2.0 vía STDIO\nHace parse del mensaje: { tool: \"delegate\", args: {...} }\nBusca el handler registrado → handleDelegate()\nInicia el lifecycle de la tarea","originalText":"🖥️ MCP Server Core\n\nRecibe el mensaje JSON-RPC 2.0 vía STDIO\nHace parse del mensaje: { tool: \"delegate\", args: {...} }\nBusca el handler registrado → handleDelegate()\nInicia el lifecycle de la tarea","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":102008,"version":1,"versionNonce":102009,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"mcp_server_box","lineHeight":1.25},

