    {"id":"build_prompt_box","type":"rectangle","x":150,"y":770,"width":380,"height":180,"strokeColor":"#047857","backgroundColor":"#a7f3d0","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":104014,"version":1,"versionNonce":104015,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[{"id":"build_prompt_text","type":"text"},{"id":"arrow_selector_to_prompt","type":"arrow"},{"id":"arrow_prompt_to_gate","type":"arrow"}],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"id":"build_prompt_text","type":"text","x":160,"y":775,"width":360,"height":170,"text":"🔨 buildPrompt() — Construcción del prompt final\n\nPaso 1: Carga template sdd-{phase}.md\n· 8 templates SDD (explore → archive)\n· 5 especializadas Odoo\n· Fallback a meta.md\n\nPaso 2: Fetch contextIds desde Engram\n· mem_get_observation() por cada ID\n· Inyecta como \"Context {id}\"\n\nPaso 3: Sustituye {variables}:\n{phase}, {change}, {instruction},\n{deliverable}, {contextIds}, {outputPath}\n\nPaso 4: Inyecta Odoo task type y skills:\n· formatOdooContextForPrompt()\n· injectKnowledgeContext()\n· Detected Skills section\n\nPaso 5: buildTaskPreamble()\n· Agrega encabezado SDD + Odoo","originalText":"🔨 buildPrompt() — Construcción del prompt final\n\nPaso 1: Carga template sdd-{phase}.md\n· 8 templates SDD (explore → archive)\n· 5 especializadas Odoo\n· Fallback a meta.md\n\nPaso 2: Fetch contextIds desde Engram\n· mem_get_observation() por cada ID\n· Inyecta como \"Context {id}\"\n\nPaso 3: Sustituye {variables}:\n{phase}, {change}, {instruction},\n{deliverable}, {contextIds}, {outputPath}\n\nPaso 4: Inyecta Odoo task type y skills:\n· formatOdooContextForPrompt()\n· injectKnowledgeContext()\n· Detected Skills section\n\nPaso 5: buildTaskPreamble()\n· Agrega encabezado SDD + Odoo","fontSize":10,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":104016,"version":1,"versionNonce":104017,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"build_prompt_box","lineHeight":1.25},

