    {"id":"path_subprocess_text","type":"text","x":210,"y":1345,"width":260,"height":190,"text":"RUTA A: SUBPROCESS (No-Antigravity)\n\nClaudeAdapter:\n· execa(\"claude\", args)\n· Modelos: haiku/sonnet/opus\n· Effort: low/medium/high\n· Timeout: 10 min\n\nCopilotAdapter, CodexAdapter,\nKiloAdapter, CursorAdapter,\nOpenCodeAdapter:\n· execa del CLI respectivo\n· Cada uno con su flag de modelo\n· Timeout por adaptador\n\nrunSubprocess() wrapper:\n· Mide duración\n· Captura stdout/stderr\n· Retorna { output, durationMs }","originalText":"RUTA A: SUBPROCESS (No-Antigravity)\n\nClaudeAdapter:\n· execa(\"claude\", args)\n· Modelos: haiku/sonnet/opus\n· Effort: low/medium/high\n· Timeout: 10 min\n\nCopilotAdapter, CodexAdapter,\nKiloAdapter, CursorAdapter,\nOpenCodeAdapter:\n· execa del CLI respectivo\n· Cada uno con su flag de modelo\n· Timeout por adaptador\n\nrunSubprocess() wrapper:\n· Mide duración\n· Captura stdout/stderr\n· Retorna { output, durationMs }","fontSize":9.5,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":106012,"version":1,"versionNonce":106013,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"path_subprocess_box","lineHeight":1.25},

    {"id":"path_terminal_box","type":"rectangle","x":1080,"y":1340,"width":320,"height":200,"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","backgroundColor":"#ddd6fe","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":106014,"version":1,"versionNonce":106015,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[{"id":"path_terminal_text","type":"text"},{"id":"arrow_to_terminal","type":"arrow"}],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"id":"path_terminal_text","type":"text","x":1090,"y":1345,"width":300,"height":190,"text":"RUTA B: TERMINAL (Antigravity / agy)\n\n1. saveTaskPrompt()\n   · Guarda prompt en Engram\n     con topic_key:\n     \"iris/task/{taskId}/prompt\"\n   · Incluye instrucciones para\n     que agy guarde output y status\n\n2. runInTerminal()\n   · Crea script PowerShell\n   · Ejecuta agy.exe en NUEVA\n     VENTANA de terminal\n   · Timeout: 16 min\n   · swapModel(model) en settings.json\n\n3. waitForEngramCompletion()\n   · Cada 3 segundos, busca\n     \"iris/task/{taskId}/status\"\n     con contenido \"DONE:{taskId}\"\n   · Cuando aparece → output listo","originalText":"RUTA B: TERMINAL (Antigravity / agy)\n\n1. saveTaskPrompt()\n   · Guarda prompt en Engram\n     con topic_key:\n     \"iris/task/{taskId}/prompt\"\n   · Incluye instrucciones para\n     que agy guarde output y status\n\n2. runInTerminal()\n   · Crea script PowerShell\n   · Ejecuta agy.exe en NUEVA\n     VENTANA de terminal\n   · Timeout: 16 min\n   · swapModel(model) en settings.json\n\n3. waitForEngramCompletion()\n   · Cada 3 segundos, busca\n     \"iris/task/{taskId}/status\"\n     con contenido \"DONE:{taskId}\"\n   · Cuando aparece → output listo","fontSize":9.5,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":106016,"version":1,"versionNonce":106017,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"path_terminal_box","lineHeight":1.25},

