    {"id":"explain_terminal_vs_subprocess","type":"text","x":610,"y":1440,"width":300,"height":70,"text":"💡 Diferencia clave:\n\nSubprocess: bloquea, espera\nel output directamente\n\nTerminal: lanza ventana nueva\nDevuelve status \"running\"\nPolling a Engram para resultado\n\nfire_and_forget: sin esperar","originalText":"💡 Diferencia clave:\n\nSubprocess: bloquea, espera\nel output directamente\n\nTerminal: lanza ventana nueva\nDevuelve status \"running\"\nPolling a Engram para resultado\n\nfire_and_forget: sin esperar","fontSize":9.5,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":106022,"version":1,"versionNonce":106023,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

