    {"id":"zone7_title","type":"text","x":60,"y":1598,"width":500,"height":20,"text":"⚪ ZONA 7: PERSISTENCIA — El resultado se guarda en el ecosistema","originalText":"⚪ ZONA 7: PERSISTENCIA — El resultado se guarda en el ecosistema","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#1e40af","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":107002,"version":1,"versionNonce":107003,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"zone7_bg","lineHeight":1.25},

    {"id":"engram_sync_box","type":"rectangle","x":150,"y":1640,"width":320,"height":200,"strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","backgroundColor":"#dbeafe","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":107004,"version":1,"versionNonce":107005,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[{"id":"engram_sync_text","type":"text"},{"id":"arrow_exec_to_engram","type":"arrow"},{"id":"arrow_engram_to_sqlite","type":"arrow"}],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"id":"engram_sync_text","type":"text","x":160,"y":1645,"width":300,"height":190,"text":"📚 Engram Sync — Memoria Persistente\n\n1. saveTaskOutput():\n   · Guarda resultado completo\n     con topic_key:\n     \"iris/task/{taskId}/output\"\n\n2. Si hay status_code:\n   mem_save:\n   · type: \"learning\"\n   · content: output resumido\n   · scope: \"project\"\n\n3. Si es teaching mode:\n   · Guarda learning artifact\n     completo en Engram\n   · title, type, scope","originalText":"📚 Engram Sync — Memoria Persistente\n\n1. saveTaskOutput():\n   · Guarda resultado completo\n     con topic_key:\n     \"iris/task/{taskId}/output\"\n\n2. Si hay status_code:\n   mem_save:\n   · type: \"learning\"\n   · content: output resumido\n   · scope: \"project\"\n\n3. Si es teaching mode:\n   · Guarda learning artifact\n     completo en Engram\n   · title, type, scope","fontSize":9.5,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":107006,"version":1,"versionNonce":107007,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"engram_sync_box","lineHeight":1.25},

    {"id":"sqlite_tasks_box","type":"rectangle","x":530,"y":1640,"width":320,"height":200,"strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","backgroundColor":"#dbeafe","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":107008,"version":1,"versionNonce":107009,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[{"id":"sqlite_tasks_text","type":"text"},{"id":"arrow_engram_to_sqlite","type":"arrow"},{"id":"arrow_sqlite_to_diagrams","type":"arrow"}],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"id":"sqlite_tasks_text","type":"text","x":540,"y":1645,"width":300,"height":190,"text":"🗄️ SQLite Task Store\n\n· db.ts — Abstracción 3 motores:\n  better-sqlite3 (sincrónico)\n  sql.js (WASM)\n  node:sqlite (nativo)\n\n· tasks.ts — CRUD completo:\n  createTask() / getTask()\n  updateTask() / deleteTask()\n  listTasks() con filtros\n\n· budgets.ts — Gasto diario:\n  recordSpend() / getDailyTotal()\n  Over-budget → fallback\n\n· Datos: taskId, provider,\n  promptTokens, outputTokens,\n  durationMs, status, error","originalText":"🗄️ SQLite Task Store\n\n· db.ts — Abstracción 3 motores:\n  better-sqlite3 (sincrónico)\n  sql.js (WASM)\n  node:sqlite (nativo)\n\n· tasks.ts — CRUD completo:\n  createTask() / getTask()\n  updateTask() / deleteTask()\n  listTasks() con filtros\n\n· budgets.ts — Gasto diario:\n  recordSpend() / getDailyTotal()\n  Over-budget → fallback\n\n· Datos: taskId, provider,\n  promptTokens, outputTokens,\n  durationMs, status, error","fontSize":9.5,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":107010,"version":1,"versionNonce":107011,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"sqlite_tasks_box","lineHeight":1.25},

    {"id":"diagrams_gen_box","type":"rectangle","x":910,"y":1640,"width":320,"height":200,"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","backgroundColor":"#ede9fe","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":107012,"version":1,"versionNonce":107013,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[{"id":"diagrams_gen_text","type":"text"},{"id":"arrow_sqlite_to_diagrams","type":"arrow"},{"id":"arrow_diagrams_to_docs","type":"arrow"}],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"id":"diagrams_gen_text","type":"text","x":920,"y":1645,"width":300,"height":190,"text":"📊 Auto Diagram Generator\n\n· diagrams/generator.ts\n· 3 tipos de diagrama:\n  · Mermaid sequence:\n    genera visión SDD completa\n  · Mermaid class:\n    modelos, campos, relaciones\n  · Mermaid flow:\n    flujo de tarea con fases\n\n· engine=\"mermaid\"\n· Inyecta en el output final\n  como bloque de código\n· Usa taskId para nombrar\n  el diagrama","originalText":"📊 Auto Diagram Generator\n\n· diagrams/generator.ts\n· 3 tipos de diagrama:\n  · Mermaid sequence:\n    genera visión SDD completa\n  · Mermaid class:\n    modelos, campos, relaciones\n  · Mermaid flow:\n    flujo de tarea con fases\n\n· engine=\"mermaid\"\n· Inyecta en el output final\n  como bloque de código\n· Usa taskId para nombrar\n  el diagrama","fontSize":9.5,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":107014,"version":1,"versionNonce":107015,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"diagrams_gen_box","lineHeight":1.25},

    {"id":"human_docs_box","type":"rectangle","x":1290,"y":1640,"width":320,"height":200,"strokeColor":"#047857","backgroundColor":"#a7f3d0","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":107016,"version":1,"versionNonce":107017,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[{"id":"human_docs_text","type":"text"},{"id":"arrow_diagrams_to_docs","type":"arrow"},{"id":"arrow_human_to_return","type":"arrow"}],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"id":"human_docs_text","type":"text","x":1300,"y":1645,"width":300,"height":190,"text":"📝 Human First Docs\n\n· Si la tarea es de tipo\n  \"documentation\" (SDD phase):\n  · Guarda output como .md\n  · Usa la ruta outputPath\n    del prompt original\n\n· outputPath se construye:\n  docs/changes/{changeName}/\n  {phase}-{timestamp}.md\n\n· Si no hay outputPath:\n  · Solo guarda en Engram\n    (no se escribe archivo)\n\n· Archivos NO se escriben\n  directamente — iris_delegate\n  usa el MCP tool respectivo","originalText":"📝 Human First Docs\n\n· Si la tarea es de tipo\n  \"documentation\" (SDD phase):\n  · Guarda output como .md\n  · Usa la ruta outputPath\n    del prompt original\n\n· outputPath se construye:\n  docs/changes/{changeName}/\n  {phase}-{timestamp}.md\n\n· Si no hay outputPath:\n  · Solo guarda en Engram\n    (no se escribe archivo)\n\n· Archivos NO se escriben\n  directamente — iris_delegate\n  usa el MCP tool respectivo","fontSize":9.5,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":107018,"version":1,"versionNonce":107019,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"human_docs_box","lineHeight":1.25},

